Source: gitui
Section: vcs
Priority: optional
Maintainer: Dario Griffo <dariogriffo@gmail.com>
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13), wget, ca-certificates
Standards-Version: 4.6.2
Homepage: https://github.com/gitui-org/gitui
Rules-Requires-Root: no

Package: gitui
Architecture: amd64 arm64 armhf
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, libc6 (>= 2.28) [arm64 armhf], libgcc-s1 [arm64 armhf]
Description: blazing fast terminal-ui for git
 gitui is a terminal UI for git, written in Rust. It provides a fast and
 intuitive interface for staging hunks and lines, browsing and inspecting the
 log, diffing, stashing, branching, rebasing, blaming and pushing, without
 leaving the terminal.
 .
 The amd64 binary shipped by upstream is a statically linked musl build and
 needs no shared libraries; the arm64 and armhf binaries are linked against
 glibc.
